              <name>SOC2</name>
              <description>SOC2 (Start of Conversion) overflow flag\nThis indicates an SOC2 interrupt was generated while an existing SOC2 interrupt was already pending. This overflow flag can&apos;t stop SOC2 interrupts from being processing. It just show that a trigger was missed. </description>
              <bitRange>[2:2]</bitRange>
              <access>read-only</access>
              <enumeratedValues>
